    skos:prefLabel "4 Establishment of Centre"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-4 ;
    values:originalText "(1) There is hereby established a Centre by the name of the Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research. (2) The Centre consists of: (a) the CEO; and (b) the staff of the Centre referred to in section 30." ;
