concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-16b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "16B Disclosure of interests"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-16b ;
    values:originalText "(1) A disclosure by a Commissioner under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) must be made to the Minister. (2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to any rules made for the purposes of that section. (3) For the purposes of this Act and the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the Commissioner is taken not to have complied with section 29 of that Act if the Commissioner does not comply with this section.   Commission for International Agricultural Research  Part III Meetings of the Commission  Division 3 Section 16C Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A disclosure by a Commissioner under section 29 of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013 (which deals with the duty to disclose interests) must be made to the Minister. (2) Subsection (1) applies in addition to any rules made for the purposes of that section. (3) For the purposes of this Act and the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013, the Commissioner is taken not to have complied with section 29 of that Act if the Commissioner does not comply with this section.   Commission for International Agricultural Research  Part III Meetings of the Commission  Division 3 Section 16C Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ef988432e7ce4ee095745f1c162904a1274cc0b59d9b1418617747d0baf4ff71" ;
