    cof:title "19 Constitution of Council" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Council shall consist of: (a) a President; (c) the person for the time being occupying, or performing the duties of, the position in the Australian Public Service known as Director-General, Australian International Development Assistance Bureau, or a person nominated by the Director-General; and (d) not fewer than 9 nor more than 11 other members." ;
