concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19A Remuneration and allowances"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-19a ;
    values:originalText "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in   The Policy Advisory Council  Part IV  Section 20 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026 operation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations. (2) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973." ;
    skos:definition "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in   The Policy Advisory Council  Part IV  Section 20 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026 operation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations. (2) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the allowances that are prescribed by the regulations. (3) This section has effect subject to the Remuneration Tribunal Act 1973."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "03cd013c1784bdd95ec914dc59bff4d40f727aa1276726f7887518158c2b2710" ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19a-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19a-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-19a-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
