    values:originalText "(1) An appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is determined by the Remuneration Tribunal. If no determination of that remuneration by the Tribunal is in   The Policy Advisory Council  Part IV  Section 20 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026 operation, the appointed member of the Council is to be paid the remuneration that is prescribed by the regulations." ;
    cof:pageNumber "20"^^xsd:integer .

