    values:originalText "(8) Subject to this section, the Council may regulate the conduct of proceedings at its meetings as it thinks fit and shall keep minutes of those proceedings.   The CEO  Part V  Section 24 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026" ;
