concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-29e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "29E CEO not subject to direction by the Commission on certain"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-29e ;
    values:originalText "matters To avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the Commission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or exercise of powers, under: (a) the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or (b) the Public Service Act 1999; in relation to the Centre.   Staff and consultants  Part VI  Section 30 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026" ;
    skos:definition "matters To avoid doubt, the CEO is not subject to direction by the Commission in relation to the CEO’s performance of functions, or exercise of powers, under: (a) the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013; or (b) the Public Service Act 1999; in relation to the Centre.   Staff and consultants  Part VI  Section 30 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026"@en ;
