    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-31-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The CEO may arrange with an Agency Head (within the meaning of the Public Service Act 1999) or with a body (other than a company or an association) established for a public purpose by or under a law of the Commonwealth for the services of officers or employees of the Agency or body to be made available to the CEO in relation to the CEO’s functions." ;
