doc:sec-32a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "32A Application of the finance law" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "For the purposes of the finance law (within the meaning of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013): (a) the following combination of bodies is a listed entity: (i) the Centre; (ii) the Commission; (iii) the Council; and (b) the listed entity is to be known as the Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research; and (c) the CEO is the accountable authority of the listed entity; and (d) the following persons are officials of the listed entity: (i) the CEO; (ii) the Commissioners; (iii) the members of the Council referred to in subsection 19(1); (iv) the staff of the Centre referred to in section 30; (v) persons whose services are made available to the CEO under section 31; (vi) consultants engaged under section 32; and (e) the purposes of the listed entity include: (i) the functions of the CEO referred to in section 5; and (ii) the functions of the staff of the Centre referred to in section 6; and (iii) the functions of the Commission referred to in section 9; and (iv) the function of the Council referred to in section 18.   The Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Account  Part VII  Section 33 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Act 1982 Compilation date: 27/03/2026" ;
    cof:pageNumber "30"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-centre-for-international-agricultural-research-act-1982-sec-33 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "33 Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-33 ;
    values:originalText "Account (1) There is continued in existence the Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Account. Note: The Account was established by subsection 5(3) of the Financial Management Legislation Amendment Act 1999. (2) The Account is a special account for the purposes of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013." ;
    skos:definition "Account (1) There is continued in existence the Australian Centre for International Agricultural Research Account. Note: The Account was established by subsection 5(3) of the Financial Management Legislation Amendment Act 1999. (2) The Account is a special account for the purposes of the Public Governance, Performance and Accountability Act 2013."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7e1b0d5641f2640ce9a953ec231eea2c27a2a7633f7d3c273e5735e2b30c10b7" ;
    cof:pageNumber "31"^^xsd:integer ;
